WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.545 --> 00:00:06.565
God, it seems like a thousand years ago

00:00:07.685 --> 00:00:09.445
that I fought my way out of that cave,

00:00:10.345 --> 00:00:11.545
became Iron Man,

00:00:14.715 --> 00:00:16.095
realized I loved you.

00:00:20.445 --> 00:00:23.325
I know I said "no more surprises" but

00:00:23.325 --> 00:00:25.515
I was really hoping to pull off one last one.

00:00:29.075 --> 00:00:30.465
The world is changed.

00:00:33.865 --> 00:00:34.885
None of us can go back.

00:00:40.005 --> 00:00:41.925
All we can do is our best

00:00:43.435 --> 00:00:45.045
and sometimes the best that we can do

00:00:46.885 --> 00:00:48.165
is to start over.

00:01:00.575 --> 00:01:02.665
I saw all these people die.

00:01:06.915 --> 00:01:08.665
I keep telling everybody they should move on.

00:01:11.305 --> 00:01:12.305
Some do

00:01:13.405 --> 00:01:14.405
but not us.

00:01:17.795 --> 00:01:20.185
Even if there's a small chance

00:01:21.325 --> 00:01:22.325
we owe this

00:01:23.895 --> 00:01:26.225
to everyone who's not in this room, to try.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.500
We will.

00:01:34.095 --> 00:01:35.095
Whatever it takes.

00:01:38.845 --> 00:01:39.845
Whatever it takes.

00:01:49.065 --> 00:01:50.425
Whatever it takes.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:20.700
I like this one.

